    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Yuya's father Yusho Sakaki explained why he left the Standard Dimension."
    },
    {
      "char": "yusho",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "The Leo Akaba I knew would listen to reason. If I could just talk to him directly, I could convince Leo to stop the invasions."
    },
    {
      "char": "yusho",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "So I used Leo Corporation's transporter to teleport across dimensions, having to leave my dimension... Having to leave Yuya behind..."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuzu",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "Then that was the day…"
    },
    {
      "char": "yusho",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "Yes. The day I was supposed to defend my title against The Sledgehammer."
    },
    {
      "char": "yusho",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "But instead of teleporting to Duel Academy, I ended up in an entirely different dimension: the Xyz Dimension."
    },
    {
      "char": "yusho",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "For teleporting to the wrong place, it was actually quite nice… until Duel Academy invaded."
    },
    {
      "char": "yusho",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "Argh…"
    },
    {
      "char": "yusho",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "alexisrhodesarcv",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yuzu",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "Alexis, why's he limping?"
    },
    {
      "char": "alexisrhodesarcv",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "He was injured in a duel with Duel Academy's greatest duelist, Aster Phoenix."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuzu",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "alexisrhodesarcv",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "BG",
      "image": "arcv_heartlandcity",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yuya",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "asterphoenixarcv",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "obeliskforce",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Back in the Xyz Dimension, Yuya was confronted by Fusion Dimension's Aster Phoenix and Obelisk Force."
    },
    {
      "char": "asterphoenixarcv",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Your name's Sakaki? You are the son of Yusho Sakaki!?"
    },
    {
      "char": "yuya",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "You know him too? I guess he really was a hero 'round here."
    },
    {
      "char": "asterphoenixarcv",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Hero? More like a zero! Your father may have eluded me, but you won't! Obelisk Force!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yuya",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "!"
    },
    {
      "char": "obeliskforce",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "Gwaaaa!"
    },
    {
      "char": "obeliskforce",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "asterphoenixarcv",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "kitetenjoarcv",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yuya",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "No way! Kite?!"
    },
    {
      "char": "kitetenjoarcv",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Guess I got here just in time."
    },
    {
      "char": "kitetenjoarcv",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Yuya! Don't worry about your friends. I'm on it."
    },
    {
      "char": "kitetenjoarcv",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yuya",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Thanks, Kite."
    },
    {
      "char": "asterphoenixarcv",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yuya",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Hope you're ready to be blown away! 'Cause it's showtime!"
    }
  ]
